00:03:32.930 --> 00:03:51.410
<v Mary Harris>The hotline is called "Never Use Alone." And the idea is, if you're going to inject heroin or do a speedball, something like that, and there's no one around, you can dial them up. Someone will stay on the line, make sure you're OK. If it seems like you've overdosed, they'll call the paramedics.
<v Mary Harris>这条热线叫“绝不独自使用”。其理念是，如果你打算注射海洛因或使用“极速球”（speedball）之类的药物，且身边没人，你可以拨打这个电话。会有人在线陪着你，确保你没事。如果看起来你服药过量了，他们会叫救护车。

00:03:51.410 --> 00:03:58.280
<v Jessie>All right, let me get some information, OK, baby? All right, give me your callback number in case we get disconnected.
