<v Mary Harris>Jessie gets the caller's phone number and address, just in case she has to call the ambulance. The caller, Kimber, is in Massachusetts. Jessie is down in Georgia.
<v Mary Harris>杰西记下了来电者的电话号码和地址，以防她不得不叫救护车。来电者金伯在马萨诸塞州。杰西在乔治亚州。

