00:04:45.040 --> 00:04:46.150
<v Kimber>OK.
<v Kimber>好的。

00:04:46.150 --> 00:04:54.220
<v Jessie>Because God forbid I have to call the ambulance-- they'll take your shit when they leave, and I don't want them to do that.
<v Jessie>因为天哪，如果我不得不叫救护车，他们离开时会收走你的那些东西，我不希望那样。

00:04:54.220 --> 00:04:59.170
<v Kimber>OK. Hold on. Let me put everything away then in the bathroom. There's like a bunch of stuff out.
