<v Jessie>然后如果你想再来一点，那么你可以再来一点，好吗？

00:08:30.350 --> 00:08:53.630
<v Mary Harris>Sometimes a person will call in wanting to talk. With the regulars, Jessie knows the names of their pets, keeps track of their birthdays. But her main job is just to stay on the line and check in every now and then. For this call, she was sitting at her kitchen table. Her husband walks in at some point for help with a Ziploc bag. But every minute or so, she's trying to get a read on Kimber.
<v Mary Harris>有时人打电话进来只是想聊天。对于常客，杰西知道他们宠物的名字，记得他们的生日。但她的主要工作只是保持通话并时不时地查看一下。这次通话时，她正坐在餐桌旁。她的丈夫在某个时刻走进来寻求帮忙拿保鲜袋。但大约每过一分钟，她都在试图了解金伯的情况。

