<v Jessie>I'm hoping that she just walked away from the phone. I try to give them 30 seconds, 30 of the longest seconds of your life. I try to give them 30 seconds to, oh, shit, I'm sorry. I walked away from the phone. Or my earbuds disconnected, or I hit the mute by accident. That's what I try to do-- 30 seconds.
